WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:02.150
Every child has a spark.

2
00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:03.800
This is GranthAI.

3
00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:07.790
In Sanskrit, granth means a book, from a root meaning to tie together.

4
00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:11.841
We tie learning, people and opportunity together, around every child.

5
00:00:13.050 --> 00:00:18.820
Talented children everywhere fall behind, not for lack of ability, but for lack of support.

6
00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:23.820
In Ireland, only fifty-four percent of children in care complete the Leaving Cert.

7
00:00:23.870 --> 00:00:27.466
And one teacher cannot sit beside twenty-five children every night.

8
00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:30.190
It starts with a profile.

9
00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:31.460
Aoife is nine.

10
00:00:31.510 --> 00:00:34.960
She picks what she loves: football, space and drawing.

11
00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:39.378
From her first answers, a Bayesian model tracks what she knows, and what to review next.

12
00:00:40.583 --> 00:00:41.793
Here's the difference.

13
00:00:41.843 --> 00:00:45.653
Aoife asks a general chatbot: what's three quarters plus a half?

14
00:00:45.703 --> 00:00:48.123
It hands her the answer, and she copies it.

15
00:00:48.173 --> 00:00:50.673
GranthAI asks her to try first.

16
00:00:50.723 --> 00:00:57.462
When she answers four sixths, it spots the exact mistake, draws the pieces, and lets her find five quarters herself.

17
00:00:58.650 --> 00:01:00.750
It works for every kind of question.

18
00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:08.390
Ask it to write your science homework, and it opens your teacher's notes and a diagram of a leaf, then asks what the plant needs from the sun.

19
00:01:08.440 --> 00:01:12.460
Ask for help revising, and it builds a quiz on your weakest topics.

20
00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:14.260
It never hands out answers.

21
00:01:14.310 --> 00:01:15.693
It helps children reach them.

22
00:01:16.883 --> 00:01:18.793
And Aoife can simply talk it through!

23
00:01:18.843 --> 00:01:23.453
On a video call, she explains her thinking to Nova, our animated AI tutor.

24
00:01:23.503 --> 00:01:30.113
When she pauses, says she's not sure, or tries again, Nova slows down, rephrases, and draws a picture.

25
00:01:30.163 --> 00:01:34.747
Nova responds to what children say, never how they feel, and keeps no recordings.

26
00:01:35.950 --> 00:01:38.900
Her feed follows her interests, to keep her curious.

27
00:01:38.950 --> 00:01:45.200
Gentle check-ins let her share how she feels, and if something is wrong, GranthAI never keeps secrets.

28
00:01:45.250 --> 00:01:47.056
It connects her with a trusted adult.

29
00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:49.810
Now picture four schools.

30
00:01:49.860 --> 00:01:51.530
Each child is a node.

31
00:01:51.580 --> 00:01:59.880
Our algorithms link children who share the same passions, across school walls, into clusters: a space club, a coding crew, an art studio.

32
00:01:59.930 --> 00:02:02.238
Aoife joins pupils from two other schools.

33
00:02:03.450 --> 00:02:09.470
Each club is matched with a vetted retired teacher as a mentor, by subject, language and time.

34
00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:13.465
Children gain role models, and retired teachers, meaningful work.

35
00:02:14.650 --> 00:02:16.390
Teachers get their time back.

36
00:02:16.440 --> 00:02:23.991
Schools upload their own curriculum and notes, and GranthAI shows where the class struggles, then helps plan the next lesson around them.

37
00:02:25.183 --> 00:02:29.848
Future Me turns interests into real routes, from college courses to apprenticeships.

38
00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:38.365
And it's safe by design: no ads, no selling data, no emotion detection, built for GDPR and the EU AI Act.

39
00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:41.760
We are starting in Ireland's DEIS schools.

40
00:02:41.810 --> 00:02:43.290
Next, the UK.

41
00:02:43.340 --> 00:02:46.940
Then Europe, where millions of children learn in a second language.

42
00:02:46.990 --> 00:02:50.900
And one day, every community where one tablet serves a whole class.

43
00:02:50.950 --> 00:02:51.950
GranthAI.

44
00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:53.438
Innovation starts with you.

